  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "例の歌番組、多くの反響がありました。\nその、視聴者からもですが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "部下"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-2:text",
        "step_id": 2,
        "step_index": 1,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 1
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "スタッフからも、有難い事務所とアイドルだったと。\nこちらが当日の番組映像です。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "部下"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "テレビを見てくれたみんな、\nワシらの曲、楽しんでくれたかのぉー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "兜 大吾"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "…おれたちはこれからも、\n精いっぱいの努力を惜しまない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "九十九 一希"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なので、応援よろしくお願いしますっ！\n以上、F-LAGSでした！　また会おうねー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋月 涼"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "映像を見せられても、ただのスポンサーでお婆ちゃん\nな私に、他のアイドルとの違いなんて分からないわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "でも、この視聴者数や問い合わせの量を見る限り、\n私の見識は誤ってたみたいね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいわ、この歌番組への出資は続行にしておいて。\nそれと、315プロのJIF出演だけど。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_08_j:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_08_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_08_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いいと思うわよ。\nそのまま内定で進めて頂戴。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "女性スポンサー"
      },
